 "traps": [
  "there is no compose file: PostgreSQL, ClickHouse, MinIO, Browserless, a SimpleSAMLphp IdP and CoreDNS are docker run targets of the Makefile",
  "Tailwind CSS and esbuild come from the Mix packages :tailwind and :esbuild, which download the binaries; assets/package.json has only Tailwind plugins",
  "mail goes through one adapter chosen by MAILER_ADAPTER: SMTP, Postmark, Mailgun, Mandrill or SendGrid, all keys read in config/runtime.exs",
  "four npm packages: assets (React dashboard), e2e and the nameless tracker (Playwright), and tracker/npm_package with no dependencies; Express in tracker serves only the test pages",
  "ExUnit ships with Elixir and has no dependency line; test/test_helper.exs is the evidence",
  "Let's Encrypt is the default ACME directory of the community edition (site_encrypt), and Google Analytics and Search Console are reached for imports",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
